Sanitized GUID forms used throughout the export — none of these may fire.

Plain counter form:      00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000042
All zeros:               00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
UUIDv4-shaped variant:   00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Another v4 variant:      00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001
Higher counter:          00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
